      "section_path": [
        "Manager Approval Dashboard",
        "Establish decision authority"
      ],
      "text": "Open Team > Approvals and check the active team and delegation dates. The dashboard combines annual leave, attendance corrections, overtime, TOIL usage, and accepted shift swaps. A notification count is a shortcut to pending work, not an authorization to view other teams. Managers cannot approve their own requests; those route to the next authorized manager or HR if no alternative is configured.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
