      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Manager Approval Dashboard",
        "Process the queue"
      ],
      "text": "Target a decision within two business days. PeopleFlow sends a reminder after one business day and escalates an undecided request to HR after three business days. These are internal queue targets and do not replace the support response SLAs in Support Priority & SLA Policy. Bulk approval is available only for annual leave and requires opening the batch summary; attendance corrections and swaps require individual review.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": 2,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": [
          63.599998474121094,
          438.8899841308594,
          194.3800048828125,
          456.7909851074219
        ],
        "element": null,
        "line": null,
        "page": 1,
        "part": null
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Manager Approval Dashboard",
        "Type-specific checks"
      ],
      "text": "Type-specific checks",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": [
          63.599998474121094,
          462.0124816894531,
          521.1271362304688,
          548.9395141601562
        ],
        "element": null,
        "line": null,
        "page": 1,
        "part": null
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Manager Approval Dashboard",
        "Type-specific checks"
      ],
      "text": "For annual leave, review coverage and contract balance under Annual Leave Policy. Current employees may cancel before leave starts without a new manager decision; the dashboard shows Cancelled afterward. For attendance, review original and proposed timelines before applying Attendance Correction Guide v2. Approval triggers recalculation within five minutes. For swaps, confirm colleague acceptance and inspect both replacement assignments, skill tags, weekly hours, and 11-hour rest intervals under Shift Schedule & Swap Guide.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": 2,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": [
